    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42833" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scalpellum</span></b> , i, n.
		(collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scal-pellus</span></b> ,
		i, m., <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 10</span></i> twice), dim.
		scalprum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a small surgical knife</i>, <i>a
