					<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 1, 26, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Ira, 2, 27, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scribae,</span>”
				<i>a penknife</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jer. 36, 23</span></i>
			.</div>
